Subject: CPMS I03 Semantic Residual Registry Baseline

@ [registry_baseline_uuid] 8408a93c-574a-44c7-8c47-a6fd22e899c7
@ [profile] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\CPMS_I03_Residual_Conformance_Profile.sop

& [RegistryRule] every residual keeps stable identity and names class roots types stage module functions disposition severity proof and rationale
  + this document locates the baseline; later implementation must encode exact records without silently weakening or merging them
  + source locations are human navigation only; function identity and content digest become compiled authority

& [RMS_R01] is recursive deserializer capacity
  + [roots] all five public roots
  + [class] representation
  + [stage] serde
  + [module] serde_json deserializer
  + [function] remaining_depth container recursion enforcement
  + [disposition] enforced_external
  + [severity] release_blocking_if_unobserved
  + [rationale] successful schema recursion does not prove the actual typed reader can descend to the same depth

& [RMS_R02] is semantic call-depth bound
  + [roots] all roots carrying ProcedureBounds directly or transitively
  + [types] ProcedureBounds CantorProcessIr ProcedureCandidate ProcedureFormSet
  + [stage] semantic
  + [module] cantor_core::procedure_validation
  + [function] validate_procedure_forms and bound validation helpers
  + [condition] maximum_call_depth is positive and no greater than 64
  + [disposition] enforced
  + [severity] release_blocking

& [RMS_R03] is procedure type recursion and local schema identity
  + [roots] all roots carrying ProcedureType or ProcedureSchemaSet
  + [types] ProcedureType ProcedureSchema ProcedureSchemaSet
  + [stage] semantic
  + [module] cantor_core::procedure_validation
  + [function] validate_schema_set validate_schema validate_type
  + [disposition] enforced
  + [severity] release_blocking

& [RMS_R04] is procedure value recursion shape and scalar fidelity
  + [roots] all roots carrying ProcedureValue
  + [types] ProcedureValue and containing forms
  + [stage] semantic
  + [module] cantor_core::procedure_validation
  + [function] validate_value
  + [condition] depth text collection map record union and scalar rules remain distinct from schema shape
  + [disposition] enforced
  + [severity] release_blocking

& [RMS_R05] is aggregate value resource accounting
  + [roots] all roots carrying ProcedureValue
  + [stage] semantic
  + [module] cantor_core::procedure_validation
  + [function] validate_value plus containing bound checks
  + [condition] maximum_value_bytes maximum_text_bytes maximum_collection_items and maximum_map_entries constrain the admitted operation context
  + [disposition] partially_enforced_pending_I03_explicit_account
  + [severity] release_blocking

& [RMS_R06] is authority admission after syntactic validity
  + [roots] run_input verify_input and response roots containing admission results
  + [stage] authority
  + [module] cantor_core Observer admission path
  + [function] fake_observer_admit and admission verification
  + [disposition] observational_outside_I03
  + [severity] authority_blocking
  + [rationale] schema serde and semantic success never grants Observer admission

& [I03_R007] is preparation successor capacity
  + [roots] prepare_input preparation_response
  + [stage] semantic
  + [module] cantor_procedure_tool
  + [function] prepare_response
  + [condition] preparation may form only a bounded valid next-pass request and honest residuals
  + [disposition] enforced

& [I03_R008] is authorship identity boundary
